cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Bangla Multimodal Political Stance"
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite the accompanying paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Morol
    given-names: Kishor
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4468-8260"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kishormorol/bangla-multimodal-political-stance"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Dataset and baselines for political stance detection in Bangla news: each
  item is labelled for the stance its framing takes toward the government,
  from the story text and the photograph published with it. Covers Bangla and
  multilingual text encoders and vision-language models under one evaluation
  protocol.
keywords:
  - bangla
  - bengali
  - political stance
  - media framing
  - multimodal
  - vision-language
